# openccu-lite's release identity (D-44), read by lite-version.mk.
# VERSION is openccu-lite's own semantic version: the tag (v<VERSION>), the artefact names
# (openccu-lite-<product>-<VERSION>.<ext>) and /VERSION's LITE= line. A prerelease track carries its
# prerelease part here (2.1.0-beta) and is built as LITE_VERSION=<VERSION>.<N>, N from the project's
# build list (never reused); a release is built with VERSION as it is.
